title: "ICU Vitals Transformer: A Hexagonal Skill Engine for Deterministic Clinical Forecasting"
abstract: "A reference architecture for safety-first clinical AI skills using the Model Context Protocol (MCP). Provides deterministic deterioration forecasting from FHIR R4 vital signs via a pure-Python hexagonal core with invariant-guarded SafetyShell."
